@startuml ProposalD_ClaudeEraHybrid
title Proposal D - Claude-Era Hybrid: A's structure + sync layer (snapshot 2026-05-20)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

actor "PowerShell user" as User
actor "GitHub viewer / community" as Viewer
actor "Keith\n(solo operator,\nfile-in-folder planning)" as Keith
actor "Future collaborator" as Future

package "Public - visible to anyone on the internet" {
  cloud "GitHub repo: greenmtnsun/GitEasy" as PubRepo {
    component "Module code + Tests + Examples" as Code
    component "README, LICENSE, CHANGELOG, CONTRIBUTING" as Top
    component "docs/UML, docs/SECURITY-FINDINGS-*" as Docs
  }
  cloud "GitHub Issues" as Issues {
    component "Community bug reports" as Bugs
    component "Roadmap items\n(MIRRORED from internal Roadmap.md\nvia sync layer below)" as Roadmap
  }
  cloud "PowerShell Gallery" as PSG {
    component "GitEasy package" as Pkg
  }
}

package "Sync layer - the part Claude unlocks" {
  component "tools/Sync-RoadmapToIssues.ps1\n(scheduled or on-edit,\nidempotent, dry-run-able)" as Sync
}

package "Private - Keith only" {
  cloud "GitHub repo: greenmtnsun/GitEasy-internal\n(private)" as PrivRepo {
    component "Roadmap.md\n(SOURCE OF TRUTH for planning)" as Plan
    component "Known-Bugs-and-Fixes.md\nPROJECT_MANIFEST.md\nDecision Records" as Internal
    component "AI session backups\n(.claude/, handoffs)\nDev tooling" as AI
  }
}

User --> Pkg : install
User --> PubRepo : reads docs
Viewer --> PubRepo : reads
Viewer --> Issues : files bug, reads roadmap

Keith --> PubRepo : commits releases
Keith --> PrivRepo : authors Roadmap.md + DRs\n(current habit preserved)
Keith --> PSG : Publish-Module

Plan --> Sync : Claude reads internal roadmap
Sync --> Roadmap : upserts labeled Issues\n(creates/updates/closes\nto match Roadmap.md state)
Bugs --> Sync : pulls inbound to local triage
Sync --> Internal : mirrors triage queue\nback to internal repo

Future ..> PrivRepo : invited on engagement

note bottom of Plan
  Keith keeps file-in-folder planning
  (current habit, full git history,
  natural in Claude sessions).
  Public visibility is automated.
end note

note bottom of Sync
  This bridge wasn't viable for a solo
  dev to build + maintain pre-Claude.
  One afternoon to author; one hook or
  schedule entry to run; zero ongoing
  manual sync burden.
end note

note bottom of PubRepo
  Anti-vibe brand carried by SECURITY-FINDINGS
  + CHANGELOG + (when sync runs) an honest
  public roadmap that cannot go stale because
  the source-of-truth file is what Keith
  actually edits in his planning sessions.
end note

@enduml
